      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARMARTA (7) missed the frame last time at this track but the start prior rocketed around 366m at Capalaba in 19.43. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. NANGAR JIM (1) ran below his best last time finishing fifth (25.83) over 457m at this track in a Grade 4/5. Has a good record at this journey. Has a strong record out of this box with six wins and a minor placing from nine starts. Great chance to atone. CANYA ATOMIC (6) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 25.48 beating Zipping Mehary. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has definite claims. DAYSEA'S KURT (3) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
